16
00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:48.127
On-demand resource!

17
00:01:49.363 --> 00:01:56.405
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:56.455 --> 00:01:58.012
Pay-as-you-go!

19
00:01:58.709 --> 00:02:07.268
Did you know? Cloud computing lets a company scale up or down instantly, paying only for the computing power they actually use!

20
